<title>USA: Vet memorandum signed at Gore-Chernomyrdin talks.</title>
<headline>Vet memorandum signed at Gore-Chernomyrdin talks.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Agriculture Secretary Dan Glickman signed a memorandum of understanding on veterinary cooperation at the seminannual Gore-Chernomyrdin talks last week, USDA General Sales Manager Chris Goldthwait said.</p>
<p>&quot;This sets a framework for discussing issues related to differences in our inspection systems that kind of thing,&quot; Goldthwait told USDA radio.</p>
